# mutgap4_res_memoryless_index_freed: A memoryless serializer texture's MTLTexture is released once its discardable resource holds it, so deleting it (40) frees its Metal resource index: one made by a 314 (a SynchronizeResource on it creates it; docs/testing.md, section 7.1) writes the index Metal gives it; after 40 a new texture Y made with a zero entry is given an index and ID Metal chooses, both dumped. Measured: X gets 1, the memoryless texture 2, and Y the freed 2. Host-keyed (Metal's indices).
